ss=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">mise registry spring-boot</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\">&gt;</span><span class=\"language-bash\">&gt;&gt; vfox:jdx/vfox-spring-boot asdf:mise-plugins/mise-spring-boot</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">mise use -g vfox:jdx/vfox-spring-boot@latest</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\">&gt;</span><span class=\"language-bash\">&gt;&gt; plugin:vfox-jdx-vfox-spring-boot <span class=\"built_in\">clone</span> https://github.com/jdx/vfox-spring-boot</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\">&gt;</span><span class=\"language-bash\">&gt;&gt; mise ~/.config/mise/config.toml tools: vfox:jdx/vfox-spring-boot@4.2.0-M2</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta prompt_\"># </span><span class=\"language-bash\">See <span class=\"built_in\">which</span> Project Types or Dependencies are supported</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">spring init --list</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">spring init --extract --build=maven --java-version=25 demo-spring-project</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"Java-Maven\"